            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Guan Dan (??), also known as Guandan or 'Throwing Eggs', is a Chinese partnership climbing and shedding card game for four players in fixed partnerships. Teams advance through rank levels from 2 through Ace; current-level hearts are wild and bombs can beat ordinary combinations.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Originated in Huai'an, Jiangsu Province, China. The name Guan Dan (??) is commonly rendered as 'Throwing Eggs' or 'Smashing Eggs'.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
